"في هذا الدرس تتكلم عن الوقت مع زملاء في بلدان أخرى. نشرح طريقتي قول الوقت، ثم فروق التوقيت بين المدن، ثم حروف الجر مع الأوقات والأيام.": "In this lesson you talk about time with colleagues in other countries. We explain the two ways to say the time, then time differences between cities, then prepositions with times and days.",
"1. قول الوقت <span class=\"ref\">ص 20</span>": "1. Telling the time <span class=\"ref\">p. 20</span>",
"للوقت طريقتان: بالأرقام كما تراها على الساعة الرقمية، أو بـ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">past</span> و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">to</span> كما في الساعة ذات العقارب.": "There are two ways to say the time: in numbers, as on a digital clock, or with <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">past</span> and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">to</span>, as on a clock with hands.",
"<b>بالأرقام:</b> الساعة ثم الدقائق: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">9.15 = nine fifteen</span>": "<b>In numbers:</b> the hour, then the minutes: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">9.15 = nine fifteen</span>",
"بالأرقام:": "In numbers:",
"<b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">past</span></b> بعد الساعة، حتى 30 دقيقة: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">9.20 = twenty past nine</span>": "<b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">past</span></b> after the hour, up to 30 minutes: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">9.20 = twenty past nine</span>",
"<b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">to</span></b> قبل الساعة التالية، بعد 30 دقيقة: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">8.45 = quarter to nine</span>": "<b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">to</span></b> before the next hour, after 30 minutes: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">8.45 = quarter to nine</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">quarter</span> ربع، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">half</span> نصف، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">o'clock</span> تماماً.": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">quarter</span>, <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">half</span>, and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">o'clock</span> (exactly).",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a.m.</span> قبل الظهر، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">p.m.</span> بعده. و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">12.00 = twelve midday / twelve noon</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a.m.</span> is before midday, and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">p.m.</span> after. <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">12.00 = twelve midday / twelve noon</span>",
"<b>السؤال:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What time is it?</span> والجواب <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's half past ten.</span>": "<b>Question:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What time is it?</span> The answer: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It's half past ten.</span>",
